Modifications made in this derivative work:

  - module path renamed to github.com/liuchun2000/rdgw and package renamed to rdgw
  - client token authentication: per-client multi-token store, constant-time
    comparison, SIGHUP hot reload with last-known-good snapshot
  - Origin allowlist for /connect handshakes
  - split listener mode separating the public /connect endpoint from the
    internal /client and /metrics endpoints
  - httputil.ReverseProxy based HTTP/HTTPS/WS/WSS proxying with per-client
    shared transports; explicit port and IPv6 authority handling; escaped
    path preservation
  - SOCKS5 egress listener for arbitrary TCP (SSH and other protocols)
  - peer TLS verification with CA bundle support; the upstream peer dialer
    used InsecureSkipVerify
  - per-listener session notification queues, multi-session dial fallback,
    read buffer and WebSocket frame size limits, deadline synchronisation
  - proxy concurrency limits, response header and body idle timeouts,
    graceful shutdown with listener rollback
